hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1264","Abu Kurayb and Abdullah bin Saeed told us, they said: Abu Khaled told us, Abdullah said, he said: Ubaid Allah told us, and Muhammad bin Al-Ala’, on the authority of Ubayd Allah, on the authority of Nafi’, on the authority of Ibn Umar, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, “used to pray wherever his mount took him.” Abdullah bin Saeed said: He prays on his mount wherever his mount takes him. They said: Ibn Omar used to do that."
"1265","Bundar told us, Abdul Ala told us, Muammar told us, on the authority of Al-Zuhri, on the authority of Abdullah bin Amir, on the authority of his father, he said: I saw the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, “prays on his mount wherever it goes.”"
